  "bookId": "2SA",
  "reference": "2 Sam 2",
  "verseCount": 32,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "2",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2SA 2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "2",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Daudi naaforwa mukama kulema ab'oruganda rwa Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebi obubyahoire, Daudi akakaguza MUKAMA ati: “Ngende omumbuga ezimu eza Yuda?” MUKAMA yamugarukamu ati: “Irooko ogende.” Daudi yagaruka yakaguza MUKAMA ati: “Hali ezi ngende omurubuga ki?” MUKAMA yamugarukamu ati: “Genda Hebburoni.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.25.42"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 25:42",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.25.43"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "43",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi yakwata omuhanda yagenda Hebburoni na bakazi be babiri: Omu nuwe Ahinohamu ayarugire Yezereeri, ondi nuwe Abigairi omufaakati muka Nabbali owa Karumeeri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yatwara n'abasaija be abayaikaraga nabo, buli omu yamutwara hamu neeka ye; baikara omumbuga za Hebburoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.31.11+1SA.31.12+1SA.31.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 31:11-13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi abantu ba Yuda bakaija Hebburoni, baaseesaho Daudi amagita, baamufoora mukama wa Yuda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi obubaamugambiire ngu abantu aba Yabbesi-giryadi nubo baaziikire Saulo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yabatumira abakwenda baabagambira bati: “MUKAMA abahe omugisa, habwokuba mukakoora obwesige, Saulo mukama wanyu mwamuziika! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na inywe MUKAMA abagirre embabazi nyingi kandi abakorre ebirungi! Na nyowe ninyija kubakorra ebirungi, habw'ekintu ekirungi ekimwakozire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonka mugume kandi mube manzi, habwokuba Saulo mukama wanyu afiire kandi abantu ba Yuda, ninyowe bakomere mbe mukama wabo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Daudi naagalihya obukama bwe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abbuneeri mutabani wa Neeri, engabwa y'ihe rya Saulo akaba akwasire Iseboseesi mutabani wa Saulo, yamutwara Mohanahimu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yamufoora mukama ow'okulema Giryadi, Abasuura, Yezereeri, ab'oruganda rwa Efuraimu noorwa Bbenyamiini, n'Abaisirairi boona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iseboseesi mutabani wa Saulo ogu, kwija kutandika kulema Isirairi, akaba ahikize emyaka amakumi ana, kandi akalemera emyaka ebiri. Baitu oruganda rwa Yuda rukasagika Daudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi akasumi Daudi akayamazire ali mukama w'enju ya Yuda omurubuga Hebburoni, kakaba k'emyaka musanju n'ekicweka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abbuneeri mutabani wa Neeri, n'abairu ba Iseboseesi mutabani wa Saulo bakaruga Mahanaimu baagenda Gibbyoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yowabbu mutabani wa Zerwiya, n'abairu ba Daudi bakagenda babaitirana hakiyanja ekya Gibbyoni; baikarra, ekitebe ekimu kyaikarra harubaju orumu orw'ekiyanja, ekindi kyaikarra harubaju orundi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abbuneeri yagambira Yowabbu ati: “Ikiriza abasigazi abo baimuke batuzaanire.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho abasigazi baimuka, baagenda babazirwe, ikumi na babiri baagenda habw'oruganda rwa Bbenyamiini, n'orwa Iseboseesi mutabani wa Saulo, ikumi na babiri abandi habw'abairu ba Daudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buli omu yakwata omunyanzigwa we omutwe, yamusimba empirima omurubaju; boona abiri na bbana, nukwo kufa bakahwaho. Ekiikaro eki, nukwo kwetwa Herikasi-hazulimu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2:16",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Herikasi-hazulimu",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "nikyo ekibanja ky'empirima y'obwogi",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " amakuru gaalyo ekiikaro eky'empirima kiri Gibbyoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha kiro eki, obulemu bwasarra. Abairu ba Daudi baabinga Abbuneeri n'Abaisirairi boona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaana ba Zeruya basatu: Yowabbu, Abisayi na Asaheeri, nabo bakaba baroho. Asaheeri akaba nairuka nk'empara, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yairukya Abbuneeri, atarukukubuutuka ha bulyo rundi hamoso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abbuneeri nubwo yarozire enyuma yakaguza ati: Asaheeri, niwe? Asaheeri yagarukamu ati: “Ninyowe”. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abbuneeri yagambira Asaheeri ati: “Kubuutuka ha mukono gwawe ogw'obulyo rundi ogw'emoso okwate omu ha basigazi abo, omunyage ebyainabyo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abbuneeri yagaruka yagambira Asaheeri ati “Lekera aho kunyirukya; habwaki noompambiriza kukwita? Obu, ndigaruka ndole nta mugenzi wawe Yowabbu?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu Asaheeri yalema kukubuutuka. Nubwo Abbuneeri kumudukura icumu, lyamuturukira omumugongo; yagwa, aho atarugeho. Boona abaahikaga Asaheeri nambere yafeeriire, baayemerraga bamaraho akasumi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu Yowabbu na Abisayi bairukya Abbuneeri; izooba obulikaba lyasa kugorooba, baahika harusozi orwa Ama orunyakuli omumaiso ga Gaaya, hamuhanda ogunyakutwara omwirungu erya Gibbyoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ab'oruganda rwa Bbenyamiini baayesorooza enyuma y'Abbuneeri, baaba kitebe kimu, baayemerra ha mutwe gw'orusozi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nubwo Abbuneeri yayeta Yowabbu yamukaguza ati: “Nukwo turakaikara niturwana tuti obutamara? Torukumanya omumaiso nkooku harukwija kubayo akabi? Abantu bawe oraabatanga di bakalekera aho kwirukya bagenzi baabo?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yowabbu yagarukamu ati: “Ndahiire Ruhanga omwomeezi, mazima kwo kakuba waba otagambire, abantu bange banu baakwongiire kwirukya bagenzi baabo okuhika nyenkya.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yowabbu nukwo kuteera engwara, abasaija boona baayemerra, baalekera aho kwirukya Abaisirairi, tibaayongera kurwana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiro eki kyona, Abbuneeri n'abasaija be bakaraba Araba; bayambuka ekyambu Yorudaani, baarubata omusana gwona, baahika Mohanaimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yowabbu yalekera aho kwirukya Abbuneeri; obuyasoroize abantu be boona, ha baheereza ba Daudi hakaba nihaburaho abasaija ikumi na mwenda otatairemu Asaheeri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaheereza ba Daudi ha basaija ba Bbenyamiini, bakaitaho bikumi bisatu, kandi ha ba Abbuneeri, baitaho nkaaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakatwara omutumbi gwa Asaheeri, baaguziika omukituuro ekikaba kiri Beterehemu ise ekiyaziikirwemu. Yowabbu abasaija be baarubata ekiro kyona, obwire kukya, bukabasanga baataaha Hebburoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
